{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(arr: list) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in an array of integers.\n\n    Handles empty arrays and cases where non-zeroes count is zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    zeros = 0\n    nonzeros = 0\n    for x in arr:\n        if x == 0:\n            zeros += 1\n        else:\n            nonzeros += 1\n\n    if zeros == 0 and nonzeros == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    elif nonzeros == 0:\n        return float('inf')\n    else:\n        return float(zeros) / nonzeros"}
