{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(s):\n    \"\"\"Counts non-overlapping occurrences of 'std' in the given string.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    idx = 0\n    needle = \"std\"\n    nlen = len(needle)\n    while True:\n        pos = s.find(needle, idx)\n        if pos == -1:\n            break\n        count += 1\n        idx = pos + nlen\n    return count"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "def next_power_of_2(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to n.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer as per the design context.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return 1\n    # If n is already a power of 2, return n.\n    if (n & (n - 1)) == 0:\n        return n\n    # Otherwise, return the next power of 2 using bit_length.\n    return 1 << n.bit_length()"}
