{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the first n even natural numbers, each raised to the fifth power, using a closed-form formula.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Calculate sum_{k=1..n} k^5 using the formula: n^2*(n+1)^2*(2n^2+2n-1)/12\n    n_squared = n * n\n    n_plus_1_squared = (n + 1) * (n + 1)\n    two_n_squared_plus_two_n_minus_1 = (2 * n_squared) + (2 * n) - 1\n    \n    sum_k_fifth = n_squared * n_plus_1_squared * two_n_squared_plus_two_n_minus_1 // 12\n    \n    # The sum of (2k)^5 is 32 * sum_k_fifth\n    return 32 * sum_k_fifth"}
