{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "def max_length(lists: list) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list of maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple (max_length: int, example_list: list or None).\n    \"\"\"\n    if not lists:\n        return (0, None)\n\n    best_len = -1\n    best_list = None\n\n    for sublist in lists:\n        current_len = len(sublist)\n        if current_len > best_len:\n            best_len = current_len\n            best_list = list(sublist)  # Return a copy to prevent external mutation\n\n    return (best_len, best_list)"}
