{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) up to P(n) inclusive using dynamic programming.\n    The Perrin sequence is defined as P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2, and P(n)=P(n-2)+P(n-3) for n>=3.\n    \"\"\"\n    perrin_numbers = {\n        0: 3,\n        1: 0,\n        2: 2\n    }\n\n    # Calculate Perrin numbers iteratively up to n and store them in the dictionary.\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        perrin_numbers[i] = perrin_numbers[i - 2] + perrin_numbers[i - 3]\n\n    # Sum all calculated Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1):\n        total_sum += perrin_numbers[k]\n\n    return total_sum"}
