{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even factors of a given number.\n    Returns 0 if the number is not positive or has no even factors.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total_even_factors_sum = 0\n    import math\n    limit = int(math.isqrt(n))\n\n    for i in range(1, limit + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            # Check factor i\n            if (i % 2) == 0:\n                total_even_factors_sum += i\n\n            # Check factor j = n // i\n            j = n // i\n            if j != i:  # Avoid double-counting for perfect squares\n                if (j % 2) == 0:\n                    total_even_factors_sum += j\n\n    return total_even_factors_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(list_of_sublists):\n    \"\"\"Finds the sublist with the minimum length. Returns the first such sublist if there's a tie.\"\"\"\n    if not list_of_sublists:\n        return []\n\n    min_sublist = list_of_sublists[0]\n\n    for sublist in list_of_sublists:\n        if len(sublist) < len(min_sublist):\n            min_sublist = sublist\n\n    return min_sublist"}
