{"task_id": "Mbpp/726", "solution": "from typing import Tuple, Union\nfrom decimal import Decimal\nNumber = Union[int, float, Decimal]\ndef multiply_elements(elements: Tuple[Number, ...]) -> Tuple[Number, ...]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the adjacent pairwise products of numbers in a tuple.\n    Returns a new tuple where each element is the product of two adjacent elements from the input.\n    \"\"\"\n    products = []\n    for i in range(len(elements) - 1):\n        products.append(elements[i] * elements[i+1])\n    return tuple(products)"}
